OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's cancer unit gets #500K
OL,4,Aupgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital says a major upgrade of one
OL,7,Fof its units will improve the
OL,8,Fexperience for generations of children.
OL,10,FA #495K charity donation has paid for
OL,11,Fseveral improvements at the children's
OL,12,Foutpatient department at the Royal
OL,13,FUnited Hospitals Bath (RUH), including
OL,14,Ftwo additional treatment spaces and
OL,15,Frefurbished waiting areas.
OL,17,FDr Polly Bates, RUH associate
OL,18,Fspecialist in paediatric oncology, said
OL,19,Fthe changes had created a "more
OL,20,Fcomfortable and nurturing environment"
OL,21,Ffor children and their families.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
